    Procedure OnNavigating tWebNavigateData  ByRef NavigateData Handle hoInvokingView Handle hoInvokingObject Boolean  ByRef bCancel
        Forward Send OnNavigating (&NavigateData) hoInvokingView hoInvokingObject (&bCancel)
    End_Procedure

    Procedure OnRefindRecordError Handle hoDD Integer eOperation Integer eReason
        Forward Send OnRefindRecordError hoDD eOperation eReason
